      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING GENTRY (4) drifted well back last start before storming home to score by 1.4 lengths over 1200m at this track. Likely to measure up again. OCEAN'S JEN (5) finished fourth two runs back at Broome then improved last time out to score by 2.5 lengths after being in the firing line on the corner over 1350m at this track. Finds a suitable race and can make it back-to-back wins. CABLE BOY (2) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start when he settled well back over 1200m at this track, beaten 1.75 lengths into fourth. Well placed and there is no reason he cannot find winning ways. MATRON SAMSING (8) was in the placings when 2.9 lengths back from the winner last start at this track and is down in weight this time. Worth including on best form. BON'S YOUR BACK (1) is racing in good order and can't be discounted on his recent form.",
